===Etymology===
*'''Rita''': The name "Rita" is often derived from the Latin word "margarita," which means "pearl." This word itself has roots in the Greek word "margaritēs," also meaning "pearl" .
*'''Repulsa''': Being ugly and evil at the same time, Rita's surname is a pun on ''repulsive'', i.e. unsightly or vile enough for one to keep their distance from.
**Her name is an example of alliteration, given that both "Rita" and "Repulsive" start with the same letter "R".

==Notes==
[[File:Purplerita.jpg|thumb|Rita Repulsa in the live stage show.]]
*The character was part of the live stage show tour, again voiced by Barbara Goodson, but sporting a much different look than seen in the series. The purple costume was reminiscent of Rita's portrayal in some U.S. ''Power Rangers'' merchandise, including coloring books and school supplies.
*Together with Rito Revolto, Rita Repulsa was the first villain in the franchise revealed to be a child of another villain.
**This also made her the first villain to have familial ties to other villains.
*Rita, [[Lord Zedd]] and [[Karone#Astronema|Astronema]] were the only villains of the [[Zordon Era]] to reappear in later seasons after they become good in "Countdown to Destruction".
*In "[[The Fate of Lightspeed]]" Pt. 2, one of the demons in the [[Shadow World]] was a mostly-obscured woman who was wearing Rita Repulsa's costume.
*Rita and the [[Black Cross Führer]] from ''[[Himitsu Sentai Gorenger]]'', are both similar in terms of being the very first main villain the first Ranger team have to defeat. Both are aliens who want to conquer Earth, aside from being the first big bad, both ''Mighty Morphin' Power Rangers'' and ''Gorenger'' are the very first entries of both the ''[[Power Rangers (series)|Power Rangers]]'' and ''[[Super Sentai]]'' franchises respectively.
*Robo-Rita successfully killed the first [[Trini Kwan|Yellow Ranger]].
**This makes her the second villain to successfully kill off a Ranger, the first was [[Psycho Pink]] (albeit indirectly and temporarily) when [[Kendrix Morgan]] was forced to sacrifice her life in the ''[[Power Rangers Lost Galaxy]]'' episode "[[The Power of Pink]]".
*Robo-Rita is the first main villain to have killed a Ranger permanently. The others: [[Ransik]], [[Octomus the Master]], [[Venjix Virus|Evox/Venjix]] killed their Rangers but it was temporary. Other villains: Psycho Pink has temporary killed the Galaxy Pink Ranger and [[Mirloc]] has killed the [[Sky Tate|S.P.D. Blue Ranger]]'s [[Officer Tate|father]].
*Her name is a alliteration much like: Peter Parker, Bruce Banner or her brother Rito Revolto.

