===Etymology===
His name is a portmanteau on the words "'''Gol'''d" and "'''Dar'''k".

"Maximus" is a latin term meaning "greatest" or "largest".

==Notes==
*Goldar is the secondary antagonist who has more appearances of Zordon's era and in the entire ''Power Rangers'' series.
*Goldar is the last villain resurrected of [[:Category:Evox Virus Army|Evox’s Army]] to be destroyed by the Rangers.
*Goldar is the first secondary antagonist to kill a main [[Sledge (Dino Charge)|villain]] even if Evox/Venjix orders him. [[Darkonda]] does not count because he kills Dark Specter who was an overarching antagonist.

